  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">VN2023NET031A103
01/09/2023 - 31/08/2024
Phase Out of Network programme with Can Tho University in Vietnam &#x201c;VLIR VIETNAM NETWORK Bioscience for food between Vietnamese and Flemish Universities&#x201d; (1) To complete the international master programmes in Aquaculture and Food Technology of the network for 13 students who have to graduate in Phase Out due to the impact of COVID-19 pandemic. (2) To finalize all the reports and organize the closing event. (3) To follow up the activities for programme sustainability (ICP connect, Erasmus, International MSc continuation at the VN network partners).</narrative>
